{
  "title": "吉隆坡机场接送：轿车、MPV还是Van",
  "slug": "airport-transfer-kuala-lumpur",
  "locale": "zh",
  "status": "PUBLISHED",
  "metaDescription": "吉隆坡机场接送：从KLIA2到酒店，选轿车、MPV还是Van？教你按人数和行李选车、选区域，以及司机在哪里等你。",
  "featureImage": null,
  "translationOf": {
    "locale": "en",
    "slug": "airport-transfer-kuala-lumpur"
  },
  "contentBlocks": [
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>最省事的吉隆坡机场接送，就是落地前订好的私人用车。在ttklia.com选你酒店所在的区域，再选一辆坐得下全部人和行李的车。司机会跟踪你的航班，举着名牌在KLIA2入境大厅等你。到吉隆坡市中心车程45到60分钟，价格在预订时就定好了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "重点速览"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<strong>去吉隆坡市中心选哪个区域？</strong>Bukit Bintang, Bangsar。这个区域包括KL Sentral。其他地区请在预订时查看区域列表。"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<strong>哪种车坐得下？</strong>人数要算，行李也要算。Budget车型坐3人、放3件行李；Family Van坐8人、放8件行李。"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<strong>在哪里见司机？</strong>过了海关，在KLIA2入境大厅。找写着你名字的名牌。"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<strong>航班延误怎么办？</strong>ttklia司机会跟踪你的航班，按实际抵达时间调整。"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "选区域"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>ttklia.com的吉隆坡机场接送按区域定价，不按街道地址。先找到酒店所在的区域，再订那条路线。以下是吉隆坡市内及周边的区域：</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:0.95em\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700\">地区</th><th style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700\">从KLIA2出发的ttklia区域</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">吉隆坡市中心</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-bukit-bintang-bangsar?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">Bukit Bintang, Bangsar</a>（包括KL Sentral）</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">吉隆坡北部和东部</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-ampang?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">Ampang</a>、<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-kepong?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">Kepong</a>、<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-duta-kiara?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">Duta Kiara</a>、<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-uiam-gombak?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">UIAM Gombak</a>、<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-bandar-baru-selayang?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">Bandar Baru Selayang</a>、<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-rawang?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">Rawang</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">吉隆坡南部</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-oug?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">OUG</a>、<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-cheras-balakong?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">Cheras, Balakong</a>、<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-kajang?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">Kajang</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Petaling Jaya一带</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-acre-damansara?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">Acre Damansara</a>、<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-subang-jaya?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">Subang Jaya</a>、<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-puchong-bukit-serdang?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">Puchong, Bukit Serdang</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Putrajaya和Cyberjaya</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-putrajaya-bangi?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">Putrajaya, Bangi</a>、<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-cyberjaya?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">Cyberjaya</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Klang和Shah Alam</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-klang-shah-alam?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">Klang, Shah Alam</a>、<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-alam-sentral-shah-alam?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">Alam Sentral, Shah Alam</a>、<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-port-klang?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">Port Klang</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>区域列表于2026年10月11日在ttklia.com核对。预订时输入酒店名称，付款前确认它属于哪个区域。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "cta",
      "content": {
        "heading": "预订KLIA2到吉隆坡市中心的接送",
        "subheading": "Bukit Bintang, Bangsar区域，包括KL Sentral。可选轿车、MPV或Van，司机在入境大厅接你。",
        "buttonText": "预订KLIA2到市中心",
        "url": "https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-bukit-bintang-bangsar?utm_source=teeko&utm_medium=blog&utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&utm_content=zh"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "选车型"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>ttklia把车分成轿车、MPV和Van（面包车），预订时按车型等级显示。人数要算，行李箱也要算，因为后车厢装不下是落地后常遇到的问题。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:0.95em\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700\">车型</th><th style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700\">乘客</th><th style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700\">行李</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Budget</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">最多3人</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">最多3件</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Premium</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">最多4人</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">最多4件</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Luxury MPV</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">最多6人</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">最多6件</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Family Van</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">最多8人</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">最多8件</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>载客量以2026年10月11日ttklia预订系统所列为准。两个大人带两个大行李箱，Budget就够。一家五口带行李，需要MPV或Van。选好合适的车型，就可以预订。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "在KLIA2和司机会合"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>取完行李、过了海关，你会走进Level 2的KLIA2入境大厅。司机就在那里，举着写有你名字的名牌等你。司机资料会随预订确认发给你，所以确认信息要存在手机里，手机也要能上网。需要SIM卡的话，出发前先看<a href=\"/zh/blog/malaysia-tourist-sim-card\">怎么在KLIA2买旅游SIM卡</a>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>没提前订？ttklia在Level 2有两个德士柜台，分别在2号门和3号门旁。<a href=\"/zh/blog/klia2-airport-taxi\">KLIA2机场德士指南</a>有带视频的步行路线。<a href=\"/zh/blog/klia2-arrival-hall\">KLIA2入境大厅指南</a>讲了从闸口到上车之间的其他事。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "KLIA2出发的其他接送"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<ul><li><strong>去KLIA Terminal 1。</strong>转机的话，ttklia有<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-klia?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">KLIA2到KLIA德士</a>。<a href=\"/zh/blog/klia1-to-klia2\">KLIA和KLIA2转乘指南</a>讲了其他方式。</li><li><strong>搭巴士去Bukit Bintang。</strong>看<a href=\"/zh/blog/klia2-to-bukit-bintang\">KLIA2到Bukit Bintang</a>，了解去Lalaport BBCC的巴士。</li><li><strong>搭火车或巴士去KL Sentral。</strong><a href=\"/zh/blog/klia2-to-kl-sentral\">KLIA2到KL Sentral指南</a>比较了票价和时间。</li><li><strong>Grab。</strong>上车点在交通枢纽LG层，不在入境大厅。</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "深夜抵达"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>ttklia德士日夜运行，所以过了午夜，订接送是稳妥的选择。最后几班KLIA Ekspres在午夜到凌晨1点之间离开机场。如果你很晚落地、隔天一早又要飞，先看<a href=\"/zh/blog/klia2-capsule-hotel\">在KLIA2过夜</a>再决定。不管怎样，登机前先订好车。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "常见问题"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "KL Sentral属于ttklia哪个区域？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>KL Sentral属于ttklia.com的Bukit Bintang, Bangsar区域。酒店在KL Sentral或附近的话，就订KLIA2到Bukit Bintang, Bangsar的接送。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "六个人带行李，从KLIA2出发一辆车坐得下吗？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>坐得下，只要订Luxury MPV，最多坐6人、放6件行李。最多8人、8件行李的话，就订Family Van。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "飞KLIA2的航班延误了怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>航班延误时，司机会按你的实际抵达时间调整，因为ttklia会跟踪你的航班。把预订确认存在手机里，万一需要客服协助就用得上。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "吉隆坡机场接送的司机在KLIA2哪里等？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>司机举着名牌在KLIA2入境大厅等你。在Level 2出了海关，找你的名字就行。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "总结"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>订吉隆坡机场接送，先找出酒店所在区域，选一辆放得下行李的车，出发前订好。司机会在KLIA2入境大厅接你。<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-bukit-bintang-bangsar?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=airport_transfer_kuala_lumpur&amp;utm_content=zh\">在ttklia.com预订KLIA2到Bukit Bintang, Bangsar和KL Sentral的接送</a>。</p>"
    }
  ]
}
